3	line	Sir Amik Varze	Subtlety isn't exactly our strong point.
3	line	Player	Can't you just take your White Knights' armour off? They wouldn't recognise you then!
3	line	Sir Amik Varze	I am afraid our charter prevents us using espionage in any form, that is the domain of the Temple Knights.
