3	line	Sir Amik Varze	That information is classified. I am forbidden to share it with outsiders.
3	line	Player	So... what do you need doing?
3	line	Sir Amik Varze	Well, the Black Knights have started making strange threats to us; demanding large amounts of money and land, and threatening to invade Falador if we don't pay them.
3	line	Sir Amik Varze	Now, NORMALLY this wouldn't be a problem...
3	line	Sir Amik Varze	But they claim to have a powerful new secret weapon.
3	line	Sir Amik Varze	Your mission, should you decide to accept it, is to infiltrate their fortress, find out what their secret weapon is, and then sabotage it.
